  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given the total resistance of the wire is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math>. If the polygon has&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math>&nbsp;numbers of side, then the resistance&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>r</mi></mfenced></math>, as shown in the following figure,&nbsp;of each side can be written as</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mi>R</mi><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/6e595b63-e39b-423f-97d2-f24d7beb398a-9896616.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 342px;\" /></p><p>Among all the resistances, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;resistances are connected in series combination, whereas, their equivalent resistance is connected in parallel with the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>n</mi><mi>th</mi></msup></math>&nbsp;resistance.&nbsp;The equivalent circuit diagram for the above set of resistances can be depicted as follows:</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/2d590221-a22b-416e-bf69-c761ee2bb75e-9896616_2.png\" style=\"width: 500px; height: 169px;\" /></p><p>From the above equivalent circuit diagram, the net equivalent resistance&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub></mfenced></math>&nbsp;for the entire combination can be calculated as follows-</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>r</mi></mstyle></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>r</mi></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>R</mi><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>R</mi><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>R</mi></mstyle></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mi>R</mi></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>R</mi></mstyle></mrow></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>R</mi></mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p>",
